SUMMARY:The Promised Land (1974)
DTSTART:20261107T220000Z
DTEND:20261108T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20261107T220000Z
UID:knchSlP75J
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 179 mins (2h59m)\n\nThis sweeping\, anti-capitalist 
 epic set in 19th century Łódź follows three friends who open a textile 
 factory during the ruthlessly competitive Industrial Revolution. Wajda’s
  first Academy Award-nominated drama remains one of his most celebrated fi
 lms.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/andrzej-wajda/the-promise
 d-land\n\nEstimated start: 14:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
